# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment output. The archive is DELIBERATELY selective: only the runs the
# paper reads are versioned, so that a reader who clones this cannot mistake a
# superseded or exploratory run for evidence. Everything excluded below is
# either an earlier version of a kept run, a smoke test, or a run whose
# generator was later found to be flawed.
#
# Versioned (do not add to this ignore list):
#   corpus_v2         500-cell agent corpus, seed 42, qwen2.5-7b
#   corpus_s43/s44    seed-sensitivity corpora
#   corpus_qwen3vl    second-model corpus
#   temporal_v2       ordering-stress suite (SHA-seeded rerun)
#   costbench_v2      26-topology verification cost sweep
#   crossover_v2      tau/G ladder (warm G, 3 repeats)
#   policies_v3       800 closed-loop policy traces
#   *.json at out/    seed_comparison, model_comparison
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
out/smoke_*
out/calib_*
out/microbench_*
out/mvp_*
out/demo_*
out/q_*
# ...except this one. Its base_state.json is the input the adversarial
# injection taxonomy is replayed from, and that replay backs the paper's only
# claim that prefix checking strictly dominates terminal checking. The
# negation names the directory, not files inside it: a file cannot be
# re-included once a parent directory is excluded.
!out/q_20260723_060529/
# superseded by the runs kept above
out/corpus_main/
out/corpus_qwen_SUPERSEDED_flawed_intents/
out/temporal_qwen/
out/policies_v2/
out/costbench_envelope/
out/costbench_validate/
